<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>SMS template submitted</title>
  <style>
    body { margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f1f5f9; -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; }
    .wrap { max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 32px 20px 48px; }
    .card { background: #ffffff; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding: 28px 24px 32px; box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.06); }
    h1 { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 8px; line-height: 1.3; }
    p { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.55; color: #334155; margin: 0 0 14px; }
    .lead { color: #475569; margin: 0 0 20px; }
    .section-title { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: #64748b; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.04em; margin: 22px 0 10px; }
    .code-block { background: #f8fafc; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; border-radius: 8px; padding: 14px 16px; margin: 10px 0 16px; }
    .btn-wrap { text-align: center; margin: 24px 0 8px; }
    a.button { display: inline-block; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffffff !important; background: #1e293b; text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 28px; border-radius: 8px; }
    .muted { font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.5; }
    .divider { height: 1px; background: #e2e8f0; margin: 20px 0; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="card">
      <h1>Your SMS template is submitted</h1>
      <p class="lead">Hi <%= @name.presence || "Merchant" %>, your template request was submitted successfully and is now under review.</p>

      <p class="section-title">Request details</p>
      <p>
        <strong>Template type:</strong> <%= @approval.template_type_key %><br />
        <strong>Status:</strong> <%= @approval.status %><br />
        <strong>Submitted at:</strong> <%= @approval.submitted_at %>
      </p>

      <p class="section-title">Submitted template</p>
      <div class="code-block"><%= @approval.body %></div>

      <p>Our team will review and approve it. Once approved, this template will go live automatically.</p>

      <div class="divider"></div>
      <div class="btn-wrap">
        <a class="button" href="https://<%= @shopify_domain %>/admin/apps/cod-verification/notifications" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Track request status</a>
      </div>
      <p class="muted" style="text-align:center;">You can view updates in Notifications → SMS template Management.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
